# Split to PRs

Load [split-to-prs](.agents/skills/split-to-prs/SKILL.md) when the user wants to split a branch, chat, or pile of changes into multiple PRs.

## Non-negotiables

- **Propose the split plan first** — no branches, commits, push, or PRs until the user approves.
- **Never discard work** — no `reset --hard`, `clean -fdx`, force-push, or branch delete without explicit approval.
- **Recoverable snapshot** before moving work (`git stash create` → `refs/backup/pre-split-…`).
- Stage **named files or hunks only** — never `git add .` / `git add -A`.
- Independent PRs off default branch; stack only when dependency is real (foundation before consumers).

## After split

Short report: PR titles/URLs and what remains on the original branch.
